{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is TrailRail?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;TrailRail&quot; is a physics-based puzzle action game characterized by a system that materializes the trajectory of the player-controlled character. Players aim to clear stages using simple controls: &quot;move left/right,&quot; &quot;jump,&quot; and &quot;materialize trajectory.&quot; The key to success lies in skillfully utilizing your envisioned ideal trajectories to &quot;push,&quot; &quot;pull,&quot; or &quot;rotate&quot; objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenging stages, which blend puzzles and action, have a clear rate of less than 5%!? Clear all stages and unravel the mysteries of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Graphics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a post-apocalyptic world rendered in beautiful pixel art.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846430?t=1757657081","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846430?t=1757657081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/fcd77be09698005e638fb8eae54eb8ddf5f50a81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757657081","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/fcd77be09698005e638fb8eae54eb8ddf5f50a81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757657081","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is TrailRail?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;TrailRail&quot; is a physics-based puzzle action game characterized by a system that materializes the trajectory of the player-controlled character. Players aim to clear stages using simple controls: &quot;move left/right,&quot; &quot;jump,&quot; and &quot;materialize trajectory.&quot; The key to success lies in skillfully utilizing your envisioned ideal trajectories to &quot;push,&quot; &quot;pull,&quot; or &quot;rotate&quot; objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenging stages, which blend puzzles and action, have a clear rate of less than 5%!? Clear all stages and unravel the mysteries of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Graphics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a post-apocalyptic world rendered in beautiful pixel art.</p>","developers":["octorain"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/fbcaabf55d3f4b1cde58c24a2fb0b1665557f170/header.jpg?t=1757657081","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257195460,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195460/movie480.mp4?t=1757656814","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195460/movie_max.mp4?t=1757656814"},"name":"TrailRail gameplay video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195460/1a2043dae9bdce199872fe66363275bfa0fd928a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757656814","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195460/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757656814","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195460/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757656814"}}],"name":"TrailRail","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Kodansha"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":